    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 104,
        "text": "Hi, thanks for coming to the library meeting. So, the garden project—we need to decide what to plant.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "0760810f10f7e4cb6bdf597f791ee5f7a89db8ea36a43be48c2f3b8190a66dd0",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 108,
        "sourceEnd": 226,
        "text": "Right. I think we should focus on native plants, which need less water. That's what the environmental group suggested.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "1a682a223290f978693d7cab4f1189e3c8286320d3a14ba848ce04d811a6d88b",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 230,
        "sourceEnd": 380,
        "text": "Yes, but wait—did they say native plants or drought-resistant plants? I think they said drought-resistant, which includes some non-native species too.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "6cd714e134b3f7f3258de983fd0d93ea005bc54b115ccbc6c12716b0a5a8e8a4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 384,
        "sourceEnd": 512,
        "text": "Oh, you're right. They said drought-resistant. Sorry. So, we could plant lavender, which is drought-resistant and attracts bees.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "affa909b695dc6a23f573f68732c1ca0dfb18b98d715c2c109b51f35b548db97",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 516,
        "sourceEnd": 689,
        "text": "Good idea. But lavender needs full sun. The area behind the library is quite shady in the afternoon. So maybe we should put lavender in the front garden, where it's sunnier.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "14dd678da3ab896458092c5752d1ef080cd94d0f0737c65cd14648079c888e3c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 693,
        "sourceEnd": 775,
        "text": "OK. And what about the shady area? We could plant ferns, which grow well in shade.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "fd287442ac0972212d2d5dbf35c068d50c6e988fbb2895ca177cff83fc014ec1",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 779,
        "sourceEnd": 931,
        "text": "Ferns are nice, but they don't flower. The children's group wanted colourful flowers. Maybe we can plant hostas—they have nice leaves and grow in shade.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "940edc3b7f2bfb5c343c8c2d15f5d920aaebd0fa0b1ed7b63a7f7c23b0f0a112",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 935,
        "sourceEnd": 1062,
        "text": "Hostas are good, but slugs love them. We might need to use slug control, which could be a problem if we want an organic garden.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f8a8f855698178763b6a10829035c06859594d1fa3358f0120be8771ade31db4",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1066,
        "sourceEnd": 1186,
        "text": "Hmm. Let's think. What if we plant wild garlic? It grows in shade, has white flowers in spring, and slugs don't like it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "14d2734caeff76ed6aa79fe6baf4daab55135b92f2193506fb8e8327f250ed3e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1190,
        "sourceEnd": 1306,
        "text": "Wild garlic? That could work. But it spreads quickly. We'd need to control it, or it might take over the whole area.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "f04f5e9ed40a451467352c0c03a9737fd40127b5e9604a7ebb78ca66617a6960",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1310,
        "sourceEnd": 1383,
        "text": "True. Maybe we can plant it in a container, which would limit its spread.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "d3ddda90e14f60b6aa0fb725d7d51d525451867d8513d2dd5a1e1b0a888839bc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1387,
        "sourceEnd": 1528,
        "text": "That's a good solution. So, front garden: lavender. Shady area: wild garlic in containers. What about the side path? It's very dry and sunny.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "d106a5f95b5eb24e8825e18bc732bff40d335330d60de7ecf3443367d6044f1a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1532,
        "sourceEnd": 1614,
        "text": "We could plant rosemary there. It's drought-resistant, evergreen, and smells nice.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "19b01bfa5a2c0d7b4f74d184f7ea96b25ca83e4f90934e494eaccfbcccc352c6",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1618,
        "sourceEnd": 1697,
        "text": "Rosemary is a good choice. But it can get quite big. We should check the space.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "2ddcfa330297273f151284f86ebc88725a22eff1c83042bdb180e2cef901cc7d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1701,
        "sourceEnd": 1783,
        "text": "The side path is about two metres wide, so rosemary should be fine if we prune it.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "5ab3e8abfa383498a79741e4ce99fc402ae8c78efdc951fe38a529067c19004c",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1787,
        "sourceEnd": 1841,
        "text": "OK. Now, who will do the planting? We need volunteers.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "fa7468a0fcf0112aba55104a59410aad606f25dc5fe82b1354b060b1e147153e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1845,
        "sourceEnd": 1956,
        "text": "The gardening club said they could help, but only on weekends. And the library staff can water during the week.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "24ce1fc560f1f36cab2ae1c71661c9cb3c2fad18428c3207f0061c896b7f4bf2",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1960,
        "sourceEnd": 2065,
        "text": "Good. So we need a schedule. Also, we should ask the local council for permission, since it's their land.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "1b64d3d2bbe97e9eb181fcba52ad7d961d3d7a5703ccdb211c0212136081f452",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 2069,
        "sourceEnd": 2159,
        "text": "Right. I'll contact the council. And I'll ask the gardening club for a list of volunteers.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-GuyNeural",
        "textHash": "dd7d4d86b67d145763a0a5488f43c413edc270724ad1995c6c98adc81ec2df16",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 2163,
        "sourceEnd": 2220,
        "text": "Great. Let's meet again next Friday to finalise the plan.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-US-AriaNeural",
        "textHash": "73c3f9c8edba72d035b0976d93b071c3e2b025c2e4e4e4366a273d622654e004",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
